#: frontend/templates/job-scams.html:5
msgid "How to Stay Safe from Job Scams – HSBC HK"
msgstr "求職騙案 - 香港滙豐"

#: frontend/templates/android-malware-safety-measures.html:13
msgid "Cyber security and fraud hub"
msgstr "網路安全及防詐騙資訊中心"

#: frontend/templates/job-scams.html:11
msgid "How to Stay Safe from Job Scams"
msgstr "心急求職，小心誤墮騙案"

#: frontend/templates/job-scams.html:18
msgid ""
"Job ads promising big pay, great benefits, and easy work can be tempting."
" But if a career opportunity sounds too good to be true, it probably is."
msgstr "看見薪高糧準、工時短、福利多的工作難免令人心動，但如果這份工真的好到難以置信，其實很有可能是求職騙案。"

#: frontend/templates/job-scams.html:19
msgid "One day, you log on to social media and this job ad pops up:"
msgstr "打開社交網站，您看到這樣的招聘廣告："

#: frontend/templates/job-scams.html:20
msgid ""
"Want to make money quickly and easily? We're hiring people to help with "
"money transfers. No experience or qualifications required. All you have "
"to do is send us a copy of your HKID card and proof of income to apply. "
"Limited openings. Call us now!"
msgstr "招請員工協助匯款，毋須學歷經驗，輕鬆月入數萬。申請時須提交收入證明及身分證副本。招請名額有限，馬上致電申請。"

#: frontend/templates/job-scams.html:21
msgid ""
"Making money quickly and easily sounds a bit too good to be true, but "
"they're hiring just a few people. You don't want to miss out on a golden "
"opportunity. It won't hurt to call and ask for details, will it? So you "
"make the call."
msgstr "輕輕鬆鬆就月入數萬？您有點懷疑，但「荀工」可能轉瞬即逝，於是您決定打電話去問問詳情。"

#: frontend/templates/job-scams.html:22
msgid ""
"\"It's an easy job. We just need to borrow your bank account to make some"
" money transfers. We'll deposit some money into your account, and once "
"you've wired the money to our account overseas, you'll receive a "
"commission. All we need is a copy of your HKID card, proof of your "
"income, proof of your address and some cash upfront to make sure you "
"won't run away once you've received the money for the transfers. It's "
"just a precaution.\""
msgstr "「我們的工作很簡單。我們會借用您的戶口匯款，您再將錢轉去別的戶口就可以賺佣。您只需要提交收入證明、住址證明和身分證副本，還要支付保證金，免得您收到匯款後失去聯絡。」"

#: frontend/templates/job-scams.html:23
msgid ""
"You think to yourself, \"They're transferring money into my account, so "
"of course they'll need my personal details and a cash deposit. That "
"sounds fair.\""
msgstr "您想：「要將錢匯到我的戶口，需要提供一些個人資料和保證金，也很合理。」"

#: frontend/templates/job-scams.html:25
msgid ""
"So you take a picture of your HKID card, pay statement and proof of "
"address, and use your mobile payment app to transfer a deposit to your "
"'future boss'. You hope you can start this project soon as it'll bring in"
" extra money without having to work hard. It's really easy!"
msgstr "於是您用手機拍下收入證明、住址證明和身分證等文件，然後打開電子支付程式，準備將保證金轉賬給您的「未來僱主」，滿心期望不用花太多力氣就可以賺錢，真好﹗"

#: frontend/templates/job-scams.html:29
msgid "Wait just a second – does it sound too perfect?"
msgstr "停一停，勿上當"

#: frontend/templates/job-scams.html:30
msgid ""
"Slow down and think. Have you ever wondered why your 'new boss' needs to "
"borrow your bank account for transfers? Why does the company need you to "
"give them copies of your pay statement, proof of address and HKID card at"
" such an early stage? And why do you have to pay them before you start "
"work?"
msgstr "慢著，先別急著開始投入「新工作」。您有沒有想過為甚麼「未來老闆」要借用您的戶口？為甚麼一開始就要您交出收入證明、住址證明和身分證副本？為甚麼上班前要先付錢？"

#: frontend/templates/job-scams.html:31
msgid ""
"The truth is: you thought you found the perfect job, but it was actually "
"a scam."
msgstr "您以為自己好運遇上「絕世筍工」，其實只是一頭栽進騙案之中。"

#: frontend/templates/job-scams.html:32
msgid ""
"\"They can't scam me if I don't pay them anything.\" Unfortunately, this "
"isn't true. Giving out your personal information will already make you "
"more likely to lose money. Fraudsters only need your online banking "
"credentials, a recent headshot, one-time-passwords (OTPs), your date of "
"birth and HKID number to complete a transaction or make a transfer in "
"your name."
msgstr "您以為不付錢就沒事？隨便提供個人資料，同樣會令您被騙的機會大增！騙徒只要掌握您的銀行登入資料、近照、一次性密碼（OTP）、出生日期和身分證號碼，就可以冒用您的名義進行交易或轉賬。"

#: frontend/templates/job-scams.html:33
msgid ""
"In fact, all that's needed to get a loan from a bank is a copy of your "
"HKID card, pay statement and proof of your home address. A scammer can "
"easily apply to borrow money and leave you responsible for their debt."
msgstr "他們更可以用您的收入證明、住址證明和身分證副本向銀行貸款，要您幫他們還錢。"

#: frontend/templates/job-scams.html:36
msgid "Tips to protect you from job scams"
msgstr "防範求職騙案貼士"

#: frontend/templates/job-scams.html:37
msgid ""
"Even if you're digitally savvy, you shouldn't underestimate the damage "
"fake online job offers could cause. Follow these tips to keep your "
"personal data safe from career scams."
msgstr "即使您經常使用數碼科技，也不要以為自己一定不會上當。記得做足以下措施，謹慎分享個人資料："

#: frontend/templates/job-scams.html:38
msgid "Don't give away too much information in job applications:"
msgstr "申請工作時，切勿提供過多個人資料"

#: frontend/templates/job-scams.html:38
msgid ""
" Details you shouldn't provide right at the beginning of a job "
"application include proof of your home address and a copy of your HKID "
"card. These details could be asked for later during a background check by"
" a legitimate company. If you're asked to provide them at the start, "
"that's a big red flag."
msgstr "申請工作時，不要一開始就提供住址證明及身分證副本等資料。正規的公司決定聘請您後，可能會要求您提供這些資料作背景審查，但如果有公司要您在申請工作時就向他們提供個人資料，一定要小心提防。"

#: frontend/templates/job-scams.html:39
msgid "Don't reveal sensitive information:"
msgstr "切勿提供敏感資料"

#: frontend/templates/job-scams.html:39
msgid ""
" Never give away information such as your online banking credentials and "
"one-time passwords (OTPs)."
msgstr "千萬不要透露銀行登入資料及一次性密碼（OTP）。"

#: frontend/templates/job-scams.html:40
msgid "Check if the job opening is authentic:"
msgstr "查探空缺真偽"

#: frontend/templates/job-scams.html:40
msgid ""
" Search for the phone number listed in the job ad on the web, and even "
"call it to check if it's linked to a reliable organisation."
msgstr "搜尋招聘廣告的電話號碼，甚至致電去查證號碼是否來自合法的公司。"

#: frontend/templates/job-scams.html:41
msgid "Do a thorough check on the people you're speaking with:"
msgstr "了解和您對話的「公司員工」"

#: frontend/templates/job-scams.html:41
msgid ""
" Even if you do reach someone on the phone who seems to have legitimate "
"information about the company, be sure to stay wary. This is because "
"fraudsters could be using a bogus number to make their scam more "
"convincing. For instance, check if they have a LinkedIn profile with a "
"photograph, and if their past work experience matches the title they "
"claim to currently hold."
msgstr "騙徒擅長在電話上假冒身分，所以即使他們侃侃而談，向您介紹「公司」背景，也要記得查探他們的身分。您可以搜尋他們有沒有LinkedIn個人檔案、上面有沒有相片，看看他們的工作經驗和職位是否吻合。"

#: frontend/templates/job-scams.html:42
msgid "Do your own research on the company:"
msgstr "事先了解公司資料"

#: frontend/templates/job-scams.html:42
msgid ""
" Look for the firm's background information, its scale of operation and "
"its address."
msgstr "例如公司背景、規模及地址。"

#: frontend/templates/job-scams.html:43
msgid "Don't pay to work:"
msgstr "不要預繳費用"

#: frontend/templates/job-scams.html:43
msgid ""
" When applying for jobs, don't pay any fees upfront to the company or "
"related parties."
msgstr "申請工作時，不要付給對方任何費用。"

#: frontend/templates/job-scams.html:45
msgid ""
"Remember, there's nothing wrong with being eager to find a new job or get"
" a higher salary. Just be aware that this could make you more vulnerable "
"to job scams."
msgstr "緊記不要因為心急求職，而誤墮騙局。"

#: frontend/templates/job-scams.html:46
msgid ""
"If you think you've already experienced a scam, don't wait any longer and"
" <a href=\"/how-to-report-fraud/\">report it to us</a> immediately."
msgstr "如果懷疑已經遇上詐騙，請即時<a href=\"/how-to-report-fraud/\">向我們舉報</a>。"

